# SG4 - Understanding Classes and Objects
## Class Name: Spotify Songs
## Class Description: A class for any Spotify songs
## Properties
| Property | Data Type | Description |
|--------------|---------|----------------------------------------------|
| songTitle   | string  | A song's title                                |
| producer     | string  | Who was mainly involved in creating the song |
| duration     | integer | The song's duration in seconds               |
| dateCreated | string  | When the song was published                   |

## Methods
| Method         | Description                                                                    |
|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| play()         | Play the song                                                                  |
| pause()        | Pauses the song                                                                |
| seek(time:int) | Jumping to a different time in a song (example: from 12 seconds to 23 seconds) |

